[statement]
As `a-condition-a-package-reached-forbids-is-not-walked-there`, with the
package the condition forbids placed only later: placing `pa` would
trigger `plug`, whose condition is `pa !pw`, and `pw` comes last, but apk
still places `plug` only where `need` reaches it, after `x` and `y`.
Observed; the rule is not yet known.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:pa x y need pw

P:pw
V:1

P:pa
V:1

P:x
V:1

P:y
V:1

P:plug
V:1
D:lib
i:pa !pw

P:lib
V:1

P:need
V:1
D:plug

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install pa 1
install x 1
install y 1
install lib 1
install plug 1
install need 1
install pw 1
install app 1
